# The reference never changes in the loop, so both the test for null and the read behind it are the same in every turn. The read is valid only where the test has passed. As emitted, it stands behind the branch.
# EMITTED-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# EMITTED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# EMITTED: Int32 b@[[isNull]] = Equal(b@{{*}}, $2(b@{{*}}), {{*}}:TypeTest)
# EMITTED-NEXT: Branch(b@[[isNull]], Terminal
# EMITTED: Load(b@{{*}}, offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# EMITTED-LABEL: end of function
# Hoisting lifts the comparison out of the loop. It does not lift the load, which is as invariant: no load of a field comes in front of the branch.
# HOISTED-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# HOISTED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# HOISTED: Int32 b@[[isNull]] = Equal(b@[[item]], $2(b@{{*}}), {{*}}:TypeTest)
# HOISTED-NEXT: Jump(
# HOISTED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# HOISTED: Branch(b@[[isNull]], Terminal
# HOISTED-NEXT: Successors: Then:Unlikely:#{{*}}, Else:#[[behind]]
# HOISTED-NEXT: BB#[[behind]]:
# HOISTED-NEXT: Predecessors:
# HOISTED-NEXT: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@[[item]], offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# HOISTED-LABEL: end of function
# The loop is then made in two versions, chosen by the branch in front of them. Now the load can leave its loop, and it lands right behind the branch.
# VERSIONED-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# VERSIONED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# VERSIONED: Int32 b@[[isNull]] = Equal(b@[[item]], $2(b@{{*}}), {{*}}:TypeTest)
# VERSIONED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# VERSIONED: Branch(b@[[isNull]], Terminal
# VERSIONED-NEXT: Successors: Then:Rare:#{{*}}, Else:#[[behind]]
# VERSIONED-NEXT: BB#[[behind]]:
# VERSIONED-NEXT: Predecessors:
# VERSIONED-NEXT: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@[[item]], offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# VERSIONED-LABEL: end of function
# It is still there after the last step, and it is the only load of the field that is left.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# CHECK-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[isNull]] = Equal(b@[[item]], $2(b@{{*}}), {{*}}:TypeTest)
# CHECK-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# CHECK: Branch(b@[[isNull]], Terminal
# CHECK-NEXT: Successors: Then:Rare:#{{*}}, Else:#[[behind]]
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#[[behind]]:
